menu "Weather service"
    config WEATHER_CITY_SEARCH_URL
        string "City search API URL prefix"
        default "https://geocoding-api.open-meteo.com/v1/search?count=6&language=en&format=json&name="
        help
            Explicit city searches append a percent-encoded query. The endpoint
            must return the Open-Meteo geocoding JSON schema. Production products
            can use a licensed endpoint or a compatible backend proxy. Location
            data attribution: GeoNames / Open-Meteo.
endmenu
